        "number": 8,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "1 To be + Supposed to In my country, you are supposed to say your first name when introducing yourself. What are you supposed to do when…? Am I expected do something special? 2 To be + Expected to People are not expected to hug others in Asia. 3 To be + Adjective + Infinitive It is not acceptable for women to wear miniskirts in Dubai. 4 To be + Custom + Infinitive It is the custom to double kiss in some European countries. To Consider 1. These expressions are not the only ones we can use. 2. There are different ways on how we can ask about customs and traditions. 3. Simple present is also useful to talk about this matter. E:G: We don’t do that here.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "1 To be + Supposed to In my country, you are supposed to say your first name when introducing yourself. What are you supposed to do when…? Am I expected do something special? 2 To be + Expected to People are not expected to hug others in Asia. 3 To be + Adjective + Infinitive It is not acceptable for women to wear miniskirts in Dubai. 4 To be + Custom + Infinitive It is the custom to double kiss in some European countries. To Consider 1. These expressions are not the only ones we can use. 2. There are different ways on how we can ask about customs and traditions. 3. Simple present is also useful to talk about this matter. E:G: We don’t do that here.",
          "There are many ways in which we can state our ideas regarding customs. Check the following chart."
